  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><b>Be Trendy Jasmine &amp; Sandal Perfumed Body Scrub, 300 g</b><br/>\r\nWith cashmere proteins and ginger extract. Create your own beauty magic with unique BE TRENDY products.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/jasmine-sandal-02(3).jpg\" width=\"600\"/><br/>\n<strong>The exclusive cashmere formula</strong> is based on a harmonious blend of exfoliating elements: fine-grain salt, apricot seed particles, and rice flour, which gently and delicately exfoliate dead skin cells.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/jasmine-sandal-01(3).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><strong>Formulated with over 20 active ingredients </strong>for nourishment, hydration, restoration, and cellulite reduction.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/jasmine-sandal-03(3).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><strong>Cashmere Proteins. </strong>The use of these proteins is based on their unique ability to stimulate collagen production and maintain skin elasticity. They form a thin protective barrier on the skin's surface that locks in moisture and deeply cares for your skin.</p>\n<p><b>Ginger Extract. </b>Driven by its powerful antioxidant properties, it helps even out skin tone and provides a light toning effect. It is widely used to boost blood circulation and stimulate healthy blood flow to the upper layers of the skin.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bergamot-patchouli-03.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><strong>The scrub is further enriched with a powerful blend of ingredients to deliver maximum results, including: </strong>Retinol, Vitamin B5, Snail Mucin, Allantoin, Vitamin C, Niacinamide, Collagen, Shea Butter, Hemp Oil, and Rose Extract. Thanks to our specially developed SALT GLOW formula, your skin will radiate with a stunning, lit-from-within glow, giving you an irresistibly attractive look.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bergamot-patchouli-04(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>A <b>niche fragrance</b> of seduction and endless possibilities, enveloping you in a luxurious trail that lasts <b>all day</b>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/jasmine-sandal-03(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>The fragrance opens with a clean, almost translucent note of <b>jasmine</b>. <b>Lilies</b> and <b>freesia</b> step in to add depth and pure sophistication. The scent locks in its magic with a base of <b>sandalwood</b> and <b>amber</b>, subtly accompanying your every movement and every single moment.</p>\n </div>\n</div>",
